<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <template id="features_section">

        <!-- SECTION TÉMOIGNAGES -->
        <div class="exo-testimonials">
            <div class="exo-testimonials-header">
                <t t-if="request.env.lang == 'fr_FR'">
                    <span class="exo-testimonials-badge">TEMOIGNAGES</span>
                    <h2>Ce que disent nos clients</h2>
                </t>
                <t t-else="">
                    <span class="exo-testimonials-badge">TESTIMONIALS</span>
                    <h2>What our clients say</h2>
                </t>
            </div>

            <div class="exo-testimonials-grid">
                <t t-if="request.env.lang == 'fr_FR'">
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Déployé 30 TPE en une semaine pour notre réseau de pharmacies. Zéro panne, zéro stress. Un partenaire de confiance.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#e74c6b;">NK</div>
                            <div><strong>Nadia K.</strong><span>Responsable IT - Groupe Pharmavie, Lille</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Notre hôtel utilise leurs terminaux depuis 3 saisons. La remontée des paiements en temps réel a changé notre gestion.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#2ecc71;">AC</div>
                            <div><strong>Alexandre C.</strong><span>Directeur - Hôtel Le Belmont, Nice</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>J'avais des doutes au départ mais l'onboarding était impeccable. Mon équipe a été formée en 2h chrono.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#9b59b6;">RL</div>
                            <div><strong>Rachid L.</strong><span>Gérant - Boulangerie Artisane, Toulouse</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Le support répond en moins d'une heure même le samedi. Pour une chaîne de 18 restaurants c'est indispensable.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#e67e22;">FD</div>
                            <div><strong>Fatima D.</strong><span>DSI - Groupe Tacos &amp; Co, Lyon</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Migration de notre ancien système sans aucune interruption de caisse. Impressionnant pour un centre commercial.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#1abc9c;">JM</div>
                            <div><strong>Julien M.</strong><span>DAF - Galeries du Sud, Montpellier</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Excellent rapport qualité prix. Les terminaux SUNMI sont robustes et le logiciel est intuitif pour mes vendeurs.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#3498db;">SB</div>
                            <div><strong>Sofia B.</strong><span>Fondatrice - Concept Store Lova, Bordeaux</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </t>
                <t t-else="">
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Deployed 30 payment terminals in one week for our pharmacy network. Zero downtime, zero stress. A trusted partner.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#e74c6b;">NK</div>
                            <div><strong>Nadia K.</strong><span>IT Manager - Groupe Pharmavie, Lille</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Our hotel has been using their terminals for 3 seasons. Real-time payment reporting has transformed our management.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#2ecc71;">AC</div>
                            <div><strong>Alexandre C.</strong><span>Director - Hôtel Le Belmont, Nice</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>I had doubts at first but the onboarding was flawless. My team was trained in just 2 hours.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#9b59b6;">RL</div>
                            <div><strong>Rachid L.</strong><span>Owner - Artisan Bakery, Toulouse</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Support responds in under an hour even on Saturdays. For a chain of 18 restaurants, that's essential.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#e67e22;">FD</div>
                            <div><strong>Fatima D.</strong><span>CIO - Groupe Tacos &amp; Co, Lyon</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Migrated our old system with zero cash register downtime. Impressive for a shopping center.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#1abc9c;">JM</div>
                            <div><strong>Julien M.</strong><span>CFO - Galeries du Sud, Montpellier</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="exo-testimonial-card">
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-quote">&#8221;</div>
                        <div class="exo-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                        <blockquote>Excellent value for money. SUNMI terminals are robust and the software is intuitive for my sales staff.</blockquote>
                        <div class="exo-testimonial-author">
                            <div class="exo-author-avatar" style="background:#3498db;">SB</div>
                            <div><strong>Sofia B.</strong><span>Founder - Concept Store Lova, Bordeaux</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </t>
            </div>

            <div class="exo-testimonials-rating">
                <div class="exo-stars exo-stars-lg">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                <t t-if="request.env.lang == 'fr_FR'">
                    <p><strong>4,9 / 5</strong> — 487 avis vérifiés</p>
                </t>
                <t t-else="">
                    <p><strong>4.9 / 5</strong> — 487 verified reviews</p>
                </t>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="oe_structure oe_empty" id="oe_structure_after_testimonials"/>

        <!-- SECTION FEATURES -->
        <section class="exo-features">
            <t t-if="request.env.lang == 'fr_FR'">
                <div class="exo-feature-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-cube"></i>
                    <div><h4>Retours faciles</h4><p>Retours sous 30 jours avec remboursement rapide.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="exo-feature-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-truck"></i>
                    <div><h4>Livraison rapide</h4><p>Livraison partout en France et Europe.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="exo-feature-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-lock"></i>
                    <div><h4>Paiement sécurisé</h4><p>Transactions 100% sécurisées et cryptées.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="exo-feature-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-shield"></i>
                    <div><h4>Qualité garantie</h4><p>Produits testés et certifiés par nos experts.</p></div>
                </div>
            </t>
            <t t-else="">
                <div class="exo-feature-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-cube"></i>
                    <div><h4>Easy returns</h4><p>Returns within 30 days with fast refund.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="exo-feature-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-truck"></i>
                    <div><h4>Fast delivery</h4><p>Delivery across France and Europe.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="exo-feature-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-lock"></i>
                    <div><h4>Secure payment</h4><p>100% secure and encrypted transactions.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="exo-feature-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-shield"></i>
                    <div><h4>Guaranteed quality</h4><p>Products tested and certified by our experts.</p></div>
                </div>
            </t>
        </section>

        <!-- BANDE PAIEMENT SÉCURISÉ -->
        <div class="exo-payment-bar">
            <t t-if="request.env.lang == 'fr_FR'">
                <span class="exo-payment-bar-title">Paiement sécurisé</span>
            </t>
            <t t-else="">
                <span class="exo-payment-bar-title">Secure payment</span>
            </t>
            <div class="exo-payment-logos">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 120 80" class="exo-pay-logo">
                    <rect width="120" height="80" rx="8" fill="#1a1f71"/>
                    <text x="60" y="52" font-family="Arial" font-size="28" font-weight="900" fill="white" text-anchor="middle">VISA</text>
                </svg>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 120 80" class="exo-pay-logo">
                    <rect width="120" height="80" rx="8" fill="white" stroke="#eee" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <circle cx="46" cy="40" r="24" fill="#eb001b"/>
                    <circle cx="74" cy="40" r="24" fill="#f79e1b"/>
                    <path d="M60 20a24 24 0 0 1 0 40A24 24 0 0 1 60 20z" fill="#ff5f00"/>
                </svg>
                <img src="/exocoms_theme/static/src/img/cb.jpg" alt="CB" class="exo-pay-logo"/>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 120 80" class="exo-pay-logo">
                    <rect width="120" height="80" rx="8" fill="#2e77bc"/>
                    <text x="60" y="36" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="900" fill="white" text-anchor="middle">AMERICAN</text>
                    <text x="60" y="54" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="900" fill="white" text-anchor="middle">EXPRESS</text>
                </svg>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 120 80" class="exo-pay-logo">
                    <rect width="120" height="80" rx="8" fill="white" stroke="#eee" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <text font-family="Arial" font-size="22" font-weight="900" y="48" x="60" text-anchor="middle">
                        <tspan fill="#003087">Pay</tspan><tspan fill="#009cde">Pal</tspan>
                    </text>
                </svg>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 120 80" class="exo-pay-logo">
                    <rect width="120" height="80" rx="8" fill="#0d4dff"/>
                    <t t-if="request.env.lang == 'fr_FR'">
                        <text x="60" y="34" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="white" text-anchor="middle">Virement</text>
                        <text x="60" y="54" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="white" text-anchor="middle">bancaire</text>
                    </t>
                    <t t-else="">
                        <text x="60" y="34" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="white" text-anchor="middle">Bank</text>
                        <text x="60" y="54" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="white" text-anchor="middle">Transfer</text>
                    </t>
                </svg>
            </div>
        </div>

    </template>
</odoo>